Placeholder, deliberately not a certificate.

The toolbox Dockerfile's EXTRA_CA and CA_BUNDLE build args default to this
file, so COPY has something to find when no certificate is being injected.
The build only installs a file that opens with a real PEM header at the start
of a line, which this one does not, so the system trust store is left alone.

Do not write that header anywhere in this file, even inside a sentence.
